  "id": "function-allocation",
  "term": "function allocation",
  "definition": "Function allocation is the way roles or task functions are divided between a human operator and a machine during cooperative work. In this context, it refers to adjusting that division dynamically to support safety and performance as mission demands or the operator’s state change.",
